<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F25.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 25</span>: </span><span id="A5.F25.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Cluster path 18<math id="A5.F25.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>13<math id="A5.F25.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>13<math id="A5.F25.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>45<span id="A5.F25.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. This image-grid shows 40 inputs that follow the same cluster path.
After divergence and NLP analysis, the identified top-3 concepts per layer are “<span id="A5.F25.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">forms | shapes | light <math id="A5.F25.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> domestic | urban | contrast urban <math id="A5.F25.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> close | domestic | warm <math id="A5.F25.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> urban | transportation | community interactions</span>.” The | operator represents an OR operation as there can be more than one key word or phrase to describe a cluster’s concept.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
