<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F26.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 26</span>: </span><span id="A5.F26.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Cluster path 18<math id="A5.F26.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>14<math id="A5.F26.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>12<math id="A5.F26.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math>68<span id="A5.F26.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. This image-grid shows 40 inputs that follow the same cluster path.
After divergence and NLP analysis, the identified top-3 concepts per layer are “<span id="A5.F26.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">forms | shapes | light <math id="A5.F26.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> texture | shapes | dark <math id="A5.F26.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> human interaction | interaction | human <math id="A5.F26.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> outdoor reflection | leisure | familial</span>.”
The | operator represents an OR operation as there can be more than one key word or phrase to describe a cluster’s concept.
</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
